        integrity: "The parent holds the question. Do not ask a model whether the truth of faith is opposed to principles the human reason knows naturally. Do not ask a model to settle a conflict between faith and reason.",
        aiLab: { setup: "Off.", childDoes: "None.", evaluate: ["Did they finish because only the false is opposed to the true?", "Did they stop after that sentence?"] },
